          "content": "<p>- Chromatic dragons patrol, wyverns and cult dragonwings in formations.\n<ul><li>Wind pressure from the ritual makes flight unstable.</p></li></ul>\n<strong>Scenes:</strong>\n1. Dogfight over the caldera.\n2. Metallic dragon escort drawn away by chromatic rivals.\n3. Group leaps/lands on bone bridges or the temple's outer level.\n4. Cult mages use <em>Earthbind</em>, <em>Hold Monster</em>, <em>Counterspell</em>.\n5. A dragon tries not to kill, but to delay.\n<p>---</p>",
