          "content": "<p>- JSON as needed.\n<ul><li>Reference: Foundry v13, dnd5e system 5.2.3.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Clear actor names, homebrew clearly marked.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>Maps: prompt first, precise and clear.</p></li></ul>\n<p>---</p>",
