          "content": "<p>- [ ] HP / spell slots tracked on character sheets\n<ul><li>[ ] Ritual clock token set to <strong>0</strong></li></ul>\n<ul><li>[ ] 4 letters printed and folded (sources: Crimson Maccath, Delaan Winterhound, Sir Isteval, King Melandrach \u2014 delivered by Remallia)</li></ul>\n<ul><li>[ ] Severin stat block printed</li></ul>\n<ul><li>[ ] Tiamat-head behavior card ready</li></ul>\n<ul><li>[ ] Last line <em>(\"Verden \u00e5nder ud.\")</em> in mind</p></li></ul>\n<p>---</p>",
